00:09:53.520 --> 00:09:56.640
Uh, so thank you, to everyone who submitted.

00:09:56.800 --> 00:09:59.600
The next challenge is going to be...

00:10:00.120 --> 00:10:01.360
about my beard!

00:10:01.360 --> 00:10:04.720
So as you bros seem to be so obsessed with it, go ahead!

00:10:04.720 --> 00:10:07.440
Do you love it? Do you hate it? Roast my beard.

00:10:07.560 --> 00:10:11.120
Are you #PewdsBeard or #PewdsShave?

00:10:11.320 --> 00:10:13.720
The hashtag with more tweets will win.

00:10:14.360 --> 00:10:18.600
The hashtag with more tweets will decide the fate of this beard.

00:10:19.040 --> 00:10:19.540
Now, go.

00:10:20.200 --> 00:10:21.640
Go forth, my children.

00:10:22.280 --> 00:10:26.240
Tell the king! Tell him about the beard!

00:10:29.800 --> 00:10:32.360
And as always, stay awesome bros!

00:10:32.360 --> 00:10:52.840
*outro music*

